The reference epoch of this gravity field model is 01 Oct 2004

Update 20 November 2008:
------------------------
Addition of the drift rates for C20, C21, S21, C30 and C40, which have to be taken
into account in accordance with the GFZ Level-2 Processing Standards Release 4.

